  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-083 (Phase 4 — app: first usable build): Topic reader: page shell and resources, message HTML builder from the normalized `MessageContent` (ADR 0006), WebView without remote scripts, page navigation, images through the cookie-less client; image loading policy C (operator 2026-10-27, recorded by LOT-071 (#95)): no private/LAN hosts, no non-image `*.hardware.fr` paths, third-party images on tap or per the image setting.\n\n### Scope\n\nTopic reader: page shell and resources, message HTML builder from the normalized `MessageContent` (ADR 0006), WebView without remote scripts, page navigation, images through the cookie-less client; image loading policy C (operator 2026-10-27, recorded by LOT-071 (#95)): no private/LAN hosts, no non-image `*.hardware.fr` paths, third-party images on tap or per the image setting\n\n- Module: App · Difficulty: difficult · Priority: high\n- Audit source: C12, C13\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-080 (#98), LOT-030 (#57), LOT-033 (#60), LOT-034 (#61), LOT-045 (#71), LOT-071 (#95)\n\n### Blocked by\n\nnone: every dependency is merged\n\n### Model\n\nOpus → Fable\n\n### Spec\n\nNo spec file on `dev-swift` yet (`docs/lots/LOT-083-*.md`).\n\n### PRs\n\n- [francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#51](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/pull/51) — Claim wave 4 (021, 022, 030, 033) and add app lots 080-083 (merged; claim/bookkeeping)\n\n### Old issue (frozen)\n\n[francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#97](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/issues/97) — read-only history.\n\n### Owner / session\n\n—\n\n### Pending captures\n\n- CAP-reho-st-image-fetched-cookie-less (#134)\n\n(Rows of the Mac capture backlog that name this lot.)\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `blocked`.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
